1
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:28,016
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:31,043
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:33,936
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:37,529
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,129 --> 00:00:40,083
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:43,056
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,963
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:49,209
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,759
The hand mold is well made.

10
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,640
You nailed the form.

11
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,439
And you captured the spirit.

12
00:00:58,759 --> 00:00:59,399
Not bad.

13
00:01:00,039 --> 00:01:00,759
Now,

14
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,439
I'm going to give you one more test.

15
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:05,480
See that?

16
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,760
Among all these molds,

17
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,879
you need to accurately identify

18
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,799
your boyfriend's hand.

19
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:14,719
Come on.

20
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,560
(Duan Xiuming,)

21
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,719
(your hands are really beautiful.)

22
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,319
This one.

23
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:55,680
Good.

24
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:58,680
You picked the right one
on the first try.

25
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:01,280
Looks like you two are really close.

26
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,200
Mr. Zhou,

27
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,200
so we passed the test, right?

28
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:07,749
You two really performed well.

29
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,719
However,

30
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,960
this is only a first test.

31
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:13,520
Many couples come to me.

32
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:16,120
I still need to compare.

33
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,439
You can go back now.

34
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:19,199
Wait for my call.

35
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,560
Are you okay?

36
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,280
Your stomach's acting up again?

37
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,000
What's wrong?

38
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,759
His stomach's not great.

39
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:37,439
I'm afraid we can't leave tonight.

40
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:39,639
Could we stay the night?

41
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,800
That's the guest room.

42
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:46,520
Suit yourself.

43
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:47,879
Thank you.

44
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,960
You hit so hard.

45
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:01,080
It was urgent.

46
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,280
You okay?

47
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,159
You know my physical condition.

48
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,479
What?

49
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,800
Feeling sorry for me?

50
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,479
All I care about
is getting Mr. Zhou on board.

51
00:03:27,914 --> 00:03:28,321
=Quite The Girl=

52
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:28,696
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

53
00:03:28,708 --> 00:03:29,068
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

54
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,240
=Episode 17=

55
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:36,919
It's cold in the mountains.

56
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,000
The ground is cold and damp.

57
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,120
This bed

58
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:44,000
will be left to...

59
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,319
your boss, me.

60
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,599
You'll have to rough it.

61
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,960
Sleep on the floor.

62
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:54,840
You're an assistant, after all.

63
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:56,599
The job requires enduring hardship.

64
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:02,479
Tomorrow we still have to play a couple.

65
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:05,240
I need a clear head to nail it.

66
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,639
If I don't sleep well

67
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:08,039
and blow the act,

68
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:09,639
who takes the blame?

69
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,639
Then may the best one win.

70
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,120
See who grabs it.

71
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,720
After so long not sharing a bed,

72
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,600
I see your talking skills have improved,

73
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,759
and so has your weight.

74
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:54,360
Guess I should thank you.

75
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,639
Working all this time,

76
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:59,079
I've been surviving on sweets.

77
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,399
Was Dongchen that rough on you?

78
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,639
Spending the night on the floor,

79
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,240
a rough business trip, isn't it?

80
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,360
How about...

81
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,319
we split the bed?

82
00:05:15,790 --> 00:05:22,665
♪You took my hand, said don't be scared♪

83
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:29,181
♪With you, no place is far♪

84
00:05:30,596 --> 00:05:36,958
♪Now I know what longing is♪

85
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:41,160
Why did you also choose
the day we broke up?

86
00:05:44,911 --> 00:05:50,641
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

87
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,560
You need a day

88
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,040
to remind yourself

89
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:58,000
not to make the same mistake.

90
00:06:00,528 --> 00:06:07,063
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

91
00:06:07,490 --> 00:06:13,365
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

92
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,199
What are you doing

93
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,759
in the workshop this late?

94
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,600
Mr. Zhou said

95
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,519
we're not the only couple here.

96
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,439
I wanted to check
the other applicants' files.

97
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,360
Know your opponent
to stay one step ahead.

98
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,240
Who's there?

99
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,439
What are you doing in the yard?

100
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:38,160
You young people these days

101
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,399
really know how to have fun!

102
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,839
Sorry, Mr. Zhou.

103
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:43,199
We wanted to try a new spot.

104
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,199
Looking for some thrills, huh?

105
00:07:44,199 --> 00:07:45,399
Pick the right spot!

106
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,319
My fault.

107
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,279
I couldn't hold back.

108
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:49,560
Please don't be mad.

109
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,560
We'll head back now.

110
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,120
Your reaction was professional.

111
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,639
All thanks to your teaching, Mr. Duan.

112
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,920
But your heartbeat just now

113
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,079
didn't seem like acting.

114
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,800
Just a normal physical response.

115
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,920
You're really good at putting on a show.

116
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,480
You're equally good
at flattering yourself.

117
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,519
We're leaving now?

118
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,080
Mr. Zhou must've noticed something
last night.

119
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,919
Us insisting on staying
would only make him

120
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:54,879
more suspicious.

121
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:56,440
Stop!

122
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:58,000
Stop!

123
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,279
Help!

124
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:01,720
Help!

125
00:09:01,855 --> 00:09:03,446
- Wanna run, huh?
- Help!

126
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,559
Stop!

127
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,639
Help!

128
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:08,320
Mind your own business,

129
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,279
or don't blame me for getting rough!

130
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,320
No gym lately. Itching to fight.

131
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,639
Talk about fate.

132
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,440
Never thought

133
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,840
you even know Zhou.

134
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,039
Thank you.

135
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:53,120
You saved my wife.

136
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:54,559
It's nothing.

137
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,600
Anyone would have done the same.

138
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:58,120
Ma'am, rest well.

139
00:09:58,146 --> 00:09:59,440
We'll be going now.

140
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:02,440
Wait.

141
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:06,000
Go ahead and take some rest.

142
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,279
Okay, go on chatting.

143
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,840
I figured it out a while ago.

144
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,360
You two aren't a couple.

145
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:25,559
Mr. Zhou,

146
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,480
sorry, we did lie to you.

147
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:29,639
You tried so hard to find me.

148
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:30,879
Tell me,

149
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,200
what's your purpose?

150
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:33,919
Mr. Zhou,

151
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:36,200
I'm Duan Xiuming from Dongchen Group.

152
00:10:36,458 --> 00:10:37,879
We came this time

153
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:39,120
to invite you to serve

154
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,919
as our company's
art exhibition consultant.

155
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:43,559
Look.

156
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,279
My ideal life

157
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:47,440
is to work with clay,

158
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,240
and live quietly

159
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:51,679
in my own little corner.

160
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,600
However,

161
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:54,960
you saved my wife today,

162
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:57,399
so I must repay this favor.

163
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:59,279
I can consult

164
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,879
for Dongchen.

165
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,919
But I have one condition.

166
00:11:38,733 --> 00:11:43,326
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

167
00:11:45,913 --> 00:11:49,866
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

168
00:11:52,893 --> 00:11:57,373
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

169
00:11:58,706 --> 00:12:03,553
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

170
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:12,593
♪A love letter written in song♪

171
00:12:12,893 --> 00:12:17,853
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

172
00:12:20,210 --> 00:12:26,356
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

173
00:12:26,882 --> 00:12:32,848
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

174
00:12:33,411 --> 00:12:40,407
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

175
00:12:41,167 --> 00:12:43,326
♪Close your eyes and count♪

176
00:12:43,617 --> 00:12:46,231
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

177
00:12:46,231 --> 00:12:52,028
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
